menu "p64"

    config P64_MAX_BRIGHTNESS
        int "Maximum panel brightness (0-255)"
        range 0 255
        default 255
        help
            Global cap applied to every scene, including the top of the
            brightness fades. Lower it (for example to 64) when the board is
            powered from a laptop USB port only: a full-white panel at 255 draws
            close to the panel's 15 W rating and will brown out a weak supply.

endmenu
